#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/bas_4ph.rst:24
msgid ""
"Cubic BAs (zincblende structure) was predicted to have an ultrahigh "
"lattice thermal conductivity of more than 2000 W/mK at room temperature "
"from first-principles calculations that include only three-phonon (3ph) "
"scattering [#lindsay2013]_. The reason is a very small three-phonon phase"
" space. Because As is about seven times heavier than B, there is a large "
"gap between the acoustic and the optical branches, so that two acoustic "
"phonons cannot merge into an optical phonon. In addition, the acoustic "
"branches are bunched together, which suppresses the scattering among "
"acoustic phonons."
msgstr ""
"立方晶 BAs (閃亜鉛鉱構造) は、3 フォノン (3ph) 散乱のみを考慮した第一原理計算により、室温で 2000 W/mK "
"を超える極めて高い格子熱伝導率をもつと予測されました [#lindsay2013]_。その理由は、3 "
"フォノン散乱の位相空間が非常に小さいことです。As は B より約 7 倍重いため、音響分枝と光学分枝の間に大きなギャップがあり、2 "
"つの音響フォノンが合体して 1 "
"つの光学フォノンになることができません。さらに、音響分枝どうしが互いに近接しているため、音響フォノン間の散乱が抑制されます。"

#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/bas_4ph.rst:31
msgid ""
"When three-phonon scattering is this weak, four-phonon (4ph) scattering "
"becomes important. Feng, Lindsay, and Ruan showed that 4ph scattering "
"reduces the predicted thermal conductivity of BAs substantially "
"[#feng2017]_, and three experiments reported room-temperature values of "
"about 1000--1300 W/mK in 2018 [#kang2018]_ [#li2018]_ [#tian2018]_."
msgstr ""
"3 フォノン散乱がこれほど弱い場合、4 フォノン (4ph) 散乱が重要になります。Feng、Lindsay、Ruan は、4ph 散乱によって "
"BAs の熱伝導率の予測値が大幅に低下することを示し [#feng2017]_、2018 年には 3 つの実験により約 1000–1300 "
"W/mK の室温での値が報告されました [#kang2018]_ [#li2018]_ [#tian2018]_。"

